# UI tests only on request

Never run `CastSnipUITests` (or `-only-testing:CastSnipUITests`) unless Eric explicitly asks.

- Release / `osxr` / `xcodebuild … test` should use the scheme default (`CastSnipTests` only).
- Do not add `CastSnipUITests` back to the scheme `testTargets` without an explicit ask.
